Privacy Policy

Last Updated: January 21, 2026

Bedtime Stories is a mobile application developed and operated by Farzad Chatrsimab. We are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains exactly what information is collected and how it is used when you operate the Bedtime Stories mobile application.

By using the application, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.

1. Information We Collect

We believe in privacy by design. We strictly limit data collection to the functional requirements necessary for the application to work.

A. Personal Information

We do not collect your name, age, phone number, physical address, or photos.

Email Address: When you sign in, we collect your email address solely for authentication purposes via Firebase Authentication. This allows you to securely access your account and recover it if you switch devices.

B. Application Data

To provide the core service of the application, we store the following data linked to your User ID:

Coin Balance: We track your current balance of virtual coins to manage story generation and refunds.

Story Content: We store the stories (text, images, and audio) and the prompts you provide so you can access them in your library.

Deletion & Refunds: If you choose to delete a story to receive a 20-coin refund, that story data is permanently removed from our database.

C. Transaction Data

We use third-party services to process payments. We do not store your credit card or banking information. We only track:

Purchase history (e.g., specific coin packs purchased).

Subscription status (if applicable).

D. Device and Usage Data

We may collect standard technical information to ensure the application runs correctly, including:

Device type and operating system.

Crash logs (to help us identify and fix bugs).

2. How We Use Your Information

We use the collected information exclusively for the following purposes:

Service Delivery: To generate text, images, and audio for your stories using Artificial Intelligence.

Account Management: To maintain your persistent login and sync your library across devices.

Inventory Management: To accurately track your coin consumption and coin refunds when you delete stories.

Customer Support: To assist you if you contact us regarding an issue with your account or a purchase.

3. Third-Party Services

We share data with trusted third-party service providers solely to facilitate the application's functionality. These providers are obligated to protect your data and do not use it for their own marketing purposes.

Google Firebase: Used for authentication (Login), database (Firestore), and cloud storage to keep your account secure and your stories saved.

Google Privacy Policy

Google Cloud Vertex AI & Gemini: Used to process your prompts and generate the story text and images.

