4. Data Retention and Deletion

Retention: We retain your email address, coin balance, and saved stories only as long as your account is active.

Story Deletion: You may delete individual stories within the application at any time. When you do so (to reclaim coins), the content is permanently deleted from our servers.

Account Deletion: You have the right to delete your account entirely. You can do this directly within the application settings. Upon account deletion, your email, coin balance, and all generated stories are permanently erased from our database.

5. Children’s Privacy

Bedtime Stories is a tool designed to help parents and users generate stories. While the content is family-friendly, the accounts are intended to be managed by adults (parents or guardians).

We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information (such as names or ages) from children under the age of 13. If you are a parent or guardian and believe that your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us so that we can delete it.

6. Security

We value your trust in providing us your information and strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect it. All data is encrypted in transit and at rest via Google Firebase's security infrastructure. However, no method of transmission over the internet or method of electronic storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee its absolute security.

7. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page. You are advised to review this page periodically for any changes.

